      "text": "shall burn unto the lowest hell, Deut. 32:22. wicked shall be turned into hell, Ps. 9:17. thou wilt not leave my soul in hell, Ps. 16:10 (Acts 2:27, 31). delivered my soul from the lowest hell, Ps. 86:13. Hell and destruction are never full, Prov. 27:20. Hell from beneath is moved for thee, Isa. 14:9 (2 Ne. 24:9). thou shalt be brought down to hell, Isa. 14:15. didst debase thyself even unto hell, Isa. 57:9. shall speak to him out of the midst of hell, Ezek. 32:21. out of the belly of hell cried I, Jonah 2:2.",
