    {
      "text": "say, Thou fool, shall be in danger of hell fire, Matt. 5:22 (3 Ne. 12:22). not that thy whole body should be cast into hell, Matt. 5:29 (18:9; Mark 9:43; 3 Ne. 12:30). fear him which is able to destroy both soul and body in hell, Matt. 10:28 (Luke 12:5). Capernaum … shalt be brought down to hell, Matt. 11:23 (Luke 10:15). gates of hell shall not prevail against it, Matt. 16:18 (D&C 10:69; 21:6; 98:22). Depart … into everlasting fire, prepared for the devil, Matt. 25:41 (D&C 29:28). go into hell, into the fire that never shall be quenched, Mark 9:43 (Isa. 66:24; Mosiah 2:38; D&C 43:33). in hell he lift up his eyes, being in torments, Luke 16:23 (D&C 104:18). cast them down to hell, and delivered them, 2 Pet. 2:4. I … have the keys of hell, Rev. 1:18. sat on him was Death, and Hell followed, Rev. 6:8. cast alive into a lake of fire burning with brimstone, Rev. 19:20 (Jacob 6:10; D&C 63:17; 76:36). death and hell delivered up the dead, Rev. 20:13. lake which burneth … which is the second death, Rev. 21:8 (Hel. 14:19; D&C 76:37).",
